      "recommendation": "Prefer: The pinned footer partitions 443,905 rows into 443,904 span-status records and one meta row; the producer meta reports 22,379 sealed, 421,525 gaps and 3,820,263 pending. Keep uniqueness/current-complete-corpus qualifications. The current paragraph is cautious but443,904 is not an explicit producer counter; it is the footer span-row count and sealed+gap sum.",
